# Local override of the GitHub account /new-repo creates repos under. Copy to
#     ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/agents-shared/new-repo-gh-account
# and keep it there, untracked. With no file, or no line matching the folder, /new-repo
# asks which account to use, as it always has.
#
# One line per rule: * or a folder (~ allowed), then a gh account name, which must already
# be logged in (`gh auth status` lists them). A folder line covers that folder and everything
# under it; the longest matching folder wins, and * covers every other folder.
#
# folder           gh account
*                  your-handle
~/dev/work         your-work-handle
